Please show your hand.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.710
Ooh, the suspense!
And, open!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:02.790
Three of a kind.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:03.790
Two pair.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.290
Three-nine!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.130
I thought I had a shot.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:12.330
Three-nine can't beat a five-five, huh?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.960
Damn novice.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.500
Whatever, that's one down.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.420
If you have no chips left, make your way over there.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.250
Bound for the Octopus Room

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.330
Whaaaat?

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:29.380
Nope. Nope!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.420
Um, is this a winning hand?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.630
Dammit...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.330
What happens if we lose?

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.290
According to the rumors...

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:51.830
Up in the bitter cold Bearing Sea,
you catch crabs without rest.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:55.500
Apparently they wear you down until
no one would ever recognize you as a maid.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:59.170
For real? Hilarious.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.460
What do we do?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.540
It's time for the next game.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.710
Then allow me to go first.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.250
Ranko, what would you do if I told you to
entrust me with all of your chips?

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.170
I would.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.080
Both my chips and my life.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.790
Thanks.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:25.420
Looks like Yumechi's gonna use Ranko's chips.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.000
Then if Yumechi loses we're done for?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.790
You've got this, Yumechi!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.710
I believe in ya!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:34.170
She's the last one, huh?

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.080
Okay now, where should we ship
those cuts of tenderloin?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.210
First betting round.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:53.380
A raise.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:57.130
This Mistress here has doubled the wager.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.130
A moe moe big chance!

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:04.630
That customer's awfully confident.
Makes me want to step up to the challenge.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.880
That should make things interesting.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:08.790
<i>What a dumb maid.</i>

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:11.330
<i>You have zero chances of winning.</i>

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.380
She calls.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.000
Check.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.000
Check.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.130
All right, it's the final betting round.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.330
Raise.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.130
That increases the wager eightfold.

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:36.420
It's the moe moe final chance!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.670
Yumechi, you've got this, right?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.880
You're okay?

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.880
No, no, no, no!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.670
What if she loses?!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.250
I hear the Bearing Sea gets down
to minus thirty degrees!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.670
They say if you fall in the water,
you die in three seconds!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.710
No way, no friggin' way.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:59.420
Dang, Yumechi had the best horoscope today,
so I thought she'd win.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.210
What do we do? What do we do?!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.080
It's your turn.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.460
<i>If you don't fold, it will be game over right now.</i>

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.330
I'm all in.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.580
Yumechi went for it!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.920
Is that really wise?

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.710
Maybe she's like, "whatevs."

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.830
<i>Why?! There's no way she can win.</i>

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.670
<i>Why is she going for it with that hand?!</i>

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.540
All right then.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.710
Please show your hands in a clockwise direction.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.540
Mistress, please show your hand.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.790
You can't call yourself a maid with that level of service.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.880
Do you think I didn't notice?

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:59.170
You never deal the top card to your shill player there,

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:01.000
in order to cheat.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.080
She's cheating?!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.500
That's not fair! Not fair at all!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.790
Better go back to your hometown and start over!

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.210
You won some and lost some so we wouldn't catch on,

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:15.080
but when you get a winning hand,
you have a habit of always fiddling with your glasses.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.830
I see right through you.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:22.290
That confident bet was a bluff to dupe me.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.250
You didn't touch your glasses this time.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.000
That means I have the winning hand.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.330
M-Mistress, what are you-

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.540
Yumechi!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.000
I knew you'd do it!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.830
Yeah, go!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.630
A full house and a full house...

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:48.500
Did Yumechi win?

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.210
Nope, she lost.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.210
What?!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.540
Well, good game.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.790
Wow, what a great game, so moving.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.000
You!

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.540
Well then, please come over here.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.210
Go ahead, go ahead.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:23.210
Right, you'll be departing at 21:00.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:25.460
You can't make me catch any crabs!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.170
My cafe! Gimme back my cafe!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.040
Quit yer whining, turd!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.170
You're gonna delay our shipment, porkbrains!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:35.130
Time is money in business.
You know that, right?! Huh?!

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.500
Huh?!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.630
Think you crappy maids no better'n garbage
can run a cafe here in Akiba?

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.670
Maybe in 50,000 years!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.460
Huh?

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.080
That's too funny.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.000
We're taking back our cafe.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.630
You lost, so back the hell down!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.750
Shut up, blockhead!
You're the ones who cheated!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:13.000
We've been putting in hard, honest work!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.960
What a drag...
Let's get this over with.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.330
I haven't used a gun in like, ages.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.380
Get back here, chumps!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.000
You'll have it maid in Hell with this!

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.460
Allow me to send you off.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:28.580
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.380
There was an explosion last night at a building in Akihabara,

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:28.580
and according to investigations,

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:31.830
Trouble in an

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:31.830
underground casino?!

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:31.830
it was due to a scuffle in an underground casino.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:31.830
Building Explodes in Akihabara

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.040
Trouble in an

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.040
underground casino?!

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:35.080
This establishment had close connections to a loan shark business

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:35.040
Underground Casino Linked to Loan Shark Busted

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.130
Awful stuff, I tell you.
and took advantage of borrowers in need of money,

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:40.580
Apparently it's not unusual these days, either.
regularly pressuring them into gambling.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.630
That explosion was a little risky.
regularly pressuring them into gambling.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:46.130
Kinda like fireworks.
Got a jump on summer, y'know?

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.420
But you know?
The loan shark's gone and the cafe's safe.

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.130
I did good, didn't I?

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:56.170
Uh, we didn't get anywhere with all the
sweets money we're behind on.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.670
The soy sauce, may I take it?

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.170
Uh, sure.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:04.830
<i>I need to calm down.</i>

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.880
<i>At least I'm still alive.</i>

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:29.630
Kyou mo ashita mo moe moe kyun

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:36.040
Butagoya atari de moe moe kyun

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:42.040
Sorega atai no ikizama sa

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:51.830
Baka ni suru yatsa chi o miruze

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.420
Mune o yogiru tamerai wa

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:06.250
Hito no kokoro no nokoriga ka

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:13.330
Ikirutomo haterutomo

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:19.170
Onore no michi o tsuranuke

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:25.540
Hikigane o hiki yagare

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:31.880
Omae ga dare nanoka

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:38.790
Itami de oshietokure
